3. Added Suspense wrapper to handle any lazy-loaded components
4. Structured the providers in the same order as shown in the component stack
5. Kept all the necessary mocks for components and functions

These changes should resolve the "Failed to fetch dynamically imported module" error by providing all the necessary context providers and mocks that the component needs to render properly.

The error was likely occurring because the component was trying to access providers and services that weren't available in the preview environment. By providing mock versions of these providers, we allow the component to render without depending on the actual implementations.

